<title>USA: Satellite Control names Sherman CEO.</title>
<headline>Satellite Control names Sherman CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SHERMAN OAKS, Calif. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Satellite Control Technologies Inc said it named Jeffrey Sherman president and chief executive, replacing Steve Lipman, who has resigned.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Satellite Control Technologies, Sherman served as president and chief executive of Classic Appearance Products and No Touch North America, a subsidiary of Taibo Industries.</p>
